26
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:22,220
This requires no moral evolution. It requires looking behind you.

27
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:31,140
Why the Banquet Exists and Nobody Has Noticed. On Wishonia, when we noticed that our species was spending the vast majority

28
